   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Not the most informative of messages, but if f is not properly initialized that will happen. I assume you run hdfs.init() Next thing would be to check that the path is correct. Does the example on our wiki page work for you? This is one possible version.<div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div>&gt; model &lt;- lm(mpg~cyl, data = mtcars)</div><div>&gt; modelfilename &lt;- &quot;my_smart_unique_name&quot;</div><div>&gt; modelfile &lt;- hdfs.file(modelfilename, &quot;w&quot;)</div><div>&gt; hdfs.write(model, modelfile)</div><div>[1] TRUE</div><div>&gt; hdfs.close(modelfile)</div><div>[1] TRUE</div><div>&gt; modelfile = hdfs.file(modelfilename, &quot;r&quot;)</div><div>&gt; m &lt;- hdfs.read(modelfile)</div><div>&gt; model &lt;- unserialize(m)</div><div>&gt; hdfs.close(modelfile)</div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Antonio</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Sunday, August 10, 2014 12:20:00 AM UTC-7, Ved J. wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I modified the buffer size to 1024*1024. <div><br></div><div>And now I get this message:<br><br><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:14px;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.253334045410156px;color:rgb(77,77,76);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(137,89,168);white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:rgb(137,89,168)\">m = hdfs.read(f)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(245,135,31)\">Error in fh$read : no field, method or inner class called &#39;read&#39; </span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:14px;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.253334045410156px;color:rgb(77,77,76);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(245,135,31)\"><br></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;font-size:14px;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:15.253334045410156px;color:rgb(77,77,76);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
